{12027}{I do not like you enough to follow you.}{I do not like you enough to follow you.}{}{11}{}{}
{12028}{Hah! You are but a child! Come back when you have experienced more of life!}{Hah! You are but a child! Come back when you have experienced more of life!}{}{12}{}{}
{12029}{Sometimes retreat is the better part of valor!}{Sometimes retreat is the better part of valor!}{}{13}{}{}
{12046}{I will do that for you.}{I will do that for you.}{}{14}{}{}
